  "modifications": [
    "FBX to glTF2 conversion; scene unit and inverse-bind normalization",
    "Original 2048px diffuse/normal imagery converted to compressed embedded JPEG; RGBA hair texture retained as PNG",
    "Nonmetallic physically based cloth/skin materials; alpha-tested matte photographic hair cards",
    "80-bone skin retained; source animation poses retargeted from animation FBX bind poses to avatar bind poses",
    "Idle, Walk, Run baked at30fps; horizontal root motion removed so game locomotion owns translation"
  ],
  "knownLimitations": [
    "Rocketbox is an older authored asset library, not a modern AAA scan.",
    "Medical avatar retains small polygonal scalp/hair highlight seams visible in extreme closeups."
  ],
